Package: mytical-desktop
Version: 0.1.0-1~resolute1
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Mytical <dev@mytical.invalid>
Depends: mytical-session, mytical-welcome, sddm, xserver-xorg, xwayland, network-manager, network-manager-gnome, pipewire, pipewire-pulse, wireplumber, xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk, gnome-keyring, libpam-gnome-keyring, gvfs, gvfs-backends, gvfs-fuse, polkitd, policykit-1-gnome, thunar, zsh, direnv, fonts-jetbrains-mono
Description: Mytical desktop system metapackage
 Pulls the APT-owned base of the Mytical desktop: login, ports, audio,
 network, keyring, file manager and fonts. The Hyprland/Kitty layer is Nix
 in the Preview and a separate APT package in the ISO.
